Since version 1.8.0 we have switched to the EQA2026-recommended reference
genomes for Human respiratory syncytial virus:

  - RSV_A: PP525321 (https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nuccore/PP525321.1/)
  - RSV_B: OR666591 (https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nuccore/OR666591)

Primer boundaries have been adjusted to match these new reference genomes.
